{"meta": {"limit": 500, "next": null, "offset": 0, "previous": null, "total_count": 63}, "objects": [{"desc": "", "id": 1, "name": "Active", "next_states": [], "order": 1, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "slug": "active", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 2, "name": "Expired", "next_states": [], "order": 2, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/2/", "slug": "expired", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 3, "name": "RFC", "next_states": [], "order": 3, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/3/", "slug": "rfc", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 4, "name": "Replaced", "next_states": [], "order": 4, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/4/", "slug": "repl", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 5, "name": "Withdrawn by Submitter", "next_states": [], "order": 5, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/5/", "slug": "auth-rm", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 6, "name": "Withdrawn by IETF", "next_states": [], "order": 6, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/6/", "slug": "ietf-rm", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Document has not yet been reviewed by IANA.", "id": 111, "name": "IANA - Review Needed", "next_states": [], "order": 1, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/111/", "slug": "need-rev", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iana-review/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Document requires IANA actions, and the IANA Considerations section indicates the details of the actions correctly.", "id": 112, "name": "IANA OK - Actions Needed", "next_states": [], "order": 2, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/112/", "slug": "ok-act", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iana-review/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Document requires no IANA action, and the IANA Considerations section indicates this correctly.", "id": 113, "name": "IANA OK - No Actions Needed", "next_states": [], "order": 3, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/113/", "slug": "ok-noact", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iana-review/", "used": true}, {"desc": "IANA has issues with the text of the IANA Considerations section of the document and/or needs to request expert approval for registry actions.", "id": 114, "name": "IANA - Not OK", "next_states": [], "order": 4, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/114/", "slug": "not-ok", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iana-review/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Document has changed after review by IANA. This state is set automatically.\r\n\r\nIANA is not notified when documents are updated.\r\n\r\nIANA reviews documents during IETF Last Call, during IESG Evaluation, and before the IESG telechat. If a review is required after the telechat (or before Last Call), please contact IANA at [email withheld by Lighthouse].", "id": 115, "name": "Version Changed - Review Needed", "next_states": [], "order": 5, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/115/", "slug": "changed", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iana-review/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The IESG has not started processing this draft, or has stopped processing it without publication.", "id": 150, "name": "I-D Exists", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/16/", "/api/v1/doc/state/11/"], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/150/", "slug": "idexists", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "A formal request has been made to advance/publish the document, following the procedures in Section 7.5 of RFC 2418. The request could be from a WG chair, from an individual through the RFC Editor, etc. (The Secretariat ([email withheld by Lighthouse]) is copied on these requests to ensure that the request makes it into the ID tracker.) A document in this state has not (yet) been reviewed by an AD nor has any official action been taken on it yet (other than to note that its publication has been requested.", "id": 16, "name": "Publication Requested", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/13/", "/api/v1/doc/state/11/", "/api/v1/doc/state/8/"], "order": 10, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/16/", "slug": "pub-req", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "A specific AD (e.g., the Area Advisor for the WG) has begun reviewing the document to verify that it is ready for advancement. The shepherding AD is responsible for doing any necessary review before starting an IETF Last Call or sending the document directly to the IESG as a whole.", "id": 13, "name": "AD Evaluation", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/21/", "/api/v1/doc/state/14/", "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "/api/v1/doc/state/11/"], "order": 11, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/13/", "slug": "ad-eval", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "An AD sometimes asks for an external review by an outside party as part of evaluating whether a document is ready for advancement. MIBs, for example, are reviewed by the \"MIB doctors\". Other types of reviews may also be requested (e.g., security, operations impact, etc.). Documents stay in this state until the review is complete and possibly until the issues raised in the review are addressed. See the \"note\" field for specific details on the nature of the review.", "id": 21, "name": "Expert Review", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/13/"], "order": 12, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/21/", "slug": "review-e", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The AD has requested that the Secretariat start an IETF Last Call, but the the actual Last Call message has not been sent yet.", "id": 14, "name": "Last Call Requested", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/15/"], "order": 15, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/14/", "slug": "lc-req", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The document is currently waiting for IETF Last Call to complete. Last Calls for WG documents typically last 2 weeks, those for individual submissions last 4 weeks.", "id": 15, "name": "In Last Call", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/19/", "/api/v1/doc/state/20/"], "order": 16, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/15/", "slug": "lc", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Before a standards-track or BCP document is formally considered by the entire IESG, the AD must write up a protocol action. The protocol action is included in the approval message that the Secretariat sends out when the document is approved for publication as an RFC.", "id": 19, "name": "Waiting for Writeup", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/20/"], "order": 18, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/19/", "slug": "writeupw", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "As a result of the IETF Last Call, comments may need to be responded to and a revision of the ID may be needed as well. The AD is responsible for verifying that all Last Call comments have been adequately addressed and that the (possibly revised) document is in the ID directory and ready for consideration by the IESG as a whole.", "id": 20, "name": "Waiting for AD Go-Ahead", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/12/"], "order": 19, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/20/", "slug": "goaheadw", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The document is now (finally!) being formally reviewed by the entire IESG. Documents are discussed in email or during a bi-weekly IESG telechat. In this phase, each AD reviews the document and airs any issues they may have. Unresolvable issues are documented as \"discuss\" comments that can be forwarded to the authors/WG. See the description of substates for additional details about the current state of the IESG discussion.", "id": 12, "name": "IESG Evaluation", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/18/", "/api/v1/doc/state/9/", "/api/v1/doc/state/22/"], "order": 20, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/12/", "slug": "iesg-eva", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "During a telechat, one or more ADs requested an additional 2 weeks to review the document. A defer is designed to be an exception mechanism, and can only be invoked once, the first time the document comes up for discussion during a telechat.", "id": 18, "name": "IESG Evaluation - Defer", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/12/"], "order": 21, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/18/", "slug": "defer", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The IESG has approved the document for publication, but the Secretariat has not yet sent out on official approval message.", "id": 9, "name": "Approved-announcement to be sent", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/10/"], "order": 27, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/9/", "slug": "approved", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The IESG has approved the document for publication, and the Secretariat has sent out the official approval message to the RFC editor.", "id": 10, "name": "Approved-announcement sent", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/17/"], "order": 30, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/10/", "slug": "ann", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The document is in the RFC editor Queue (as confirmed by https://www.rfc-editor.org/queue.html).", "id": 17, "name": "RFC Ed Queue", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/7/"], "order": 31, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/17/", "slug": "rfcqueue", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The ID has been published as an RFC.", "id": 7, "name": "RFC Published", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/8/"], "order": 32, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/7/", "slug": "pub", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Do Not Publish: The IESG recommends against publishing the document, but the writeup explaining its reasoning has not yet been produced. DNPs apply primarily to individual submissions received through the RFC editor.  See the \"note\" field for more details on who has the action item.", "id": 22, "name": "DNP-waiting for AD note", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/23/"], "order": 33, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/22/", "slug": "nopubadw", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The IESG recommends against publishing the document, the writeup explaining its reasoning has been produced, but the Secretariat has not yet sent out the official \"do not publish\" recommendation message.", "id": 23, "name": "DNP-announcement to be sent", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/8/"], "order": 34, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/23/", "slug": "nopubanw", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "An AD is aware of the document and has chosen to place the document in a separate state in order to keep a closer eye on it (for whatever reason). Documents in this state are still not being actively tracked in the sense that no formal request has been made to publish or advance the document. The sole difference between this state and \"I-D Exists\" is that an AD has chosen to put it in a separate state, to make it easier to keep track of (for the AD's own reasons).", "id": 11, "name": "AD is watching", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/16/"], "order": 42, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/11/", "slug": "watching", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": false}, {"desc": "Document is \"dead\" and is no longer being tracked. (E.g., it has been replaced by another document with a different name, it has been withdrawn, etc.)", "id": 8, "name": "Dead", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/16/"], "order": 99, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/8/", "slug": "dead", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-iesg/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 217, "name": "Blocked", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/217/", "slug": "blocked", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Awaiting author action", "id": 24, "name": "AUTH", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/24/", "slug": "auth", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Awaiting final author approval", "id": 25, "name": "AUTH48", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/25/", "slug": "auth48", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Approved by the stream manager (e.g., IESG, IAB, IRSG, ISE), awaiting processing and publishing", "id": 26, "name": "EDIT", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/26/", "slug": "edit", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": false}, {"desc": "Document has been edited, but is holding for completion of IANA actions", "id": 27, "name": "IANA", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/27/", "slug": "iana", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Awaiting IESG action", "id": 28, "name": "IESG", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/28/", "slug": "iesg", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": false}, {"desc": "Independent Submission Review by the ISE ", "id": 29, "name": "ISR", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/29/", "slug": "isr", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Independent submission awaiting author action, or in discussion between author and ISE", "id": 30, "name": "ISR-AUTH", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/30/", "slug": "isr-auth", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": false}, {"desc": "Holding for normative reference", "id": 31, "name": "REF", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/31/", "slug": "ref", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Awaiting final RFC Editor review before AUTH48", "id": 32, "name": "RFC-EDITOR", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/32/", "slug": "rfc-edit", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Time-out period during which the IESG reviews document for conflict/concurrence with other IETF working group work", "id": 33, "name": "TO", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/33/", "slug": "timeout", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Awaiting missing normative reference", "id": 34, "name": "MISSREF", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/34/", "slug": "missref", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Final approvals are complete", "id": 89, "name": "AUTH48-DONE", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/74/"], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/89/", "slug": "auth48done", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": false}, {"desc": "Final approvals are complete", "id": 116, "name": "AUTH48-DONE", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/116/", "slug": "auth48-done", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Approved by the stream manager (e.g., IESG, IAB, IRSG, ISE), awaiting processing and publishing", "id": 117, "name": "EDIT", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/117/", "slug": "edit", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "RFC-Editor/IANA Registration Coordination", "id": 118, "name": "IANA", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/118/", "slug": "iana-crd", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Holding for IESG action", "id": 119, "name": "IESG", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/119/", "slug": "iesg", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Independent Submission awaiting author update, or in discussion between author and ISE", "id": 120, "name": "ISR-AUTH", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/120/", "slug": "isr-auth", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 133, "name": "Pending", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/133/", "slug": "pending", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Tooling Issue; an update is needed to one or more of the tools in the publication pipeline before this document can be published", "id": 155, "name": "TI", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/155/", "slug": "tooling-issue", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "", "id": 216, "name": "In Progress", "next_states": [], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/216/", "slug": "in_progress", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-rfceditor/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The individual submission document has been marked by the Working Group (WG) chairs as a candidate for adoption by the WG, but no adoption call has been started.", "id": 134, "name": "Candidate for WG Adoption", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/35/"], "order": 0, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/134/", "slug": "wg-cand", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "A call for adoption of the individual submission document has been issued by the Working Group (WG) chairs.  This call is still running but the WG has not yet reached consensus for adoption.", "id": 35, "name": "Call For Adoption By WG Issued", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/36/", "/api/v1/doc/state/37/"], "order": 1, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/35/", "slug": "c-adopt", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The individual submission document has been adopted by the Working Group (WG), but some administrative matter still needs to be completed (e.g., a WG document replacing this document with the typical naming convention of 'draft-ietf-wgname-topic-nn' has not yet been submitted).", "id": 36, "name": "Adopted by a WG", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "order": 2, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/36/", "slug": "adopt-wg", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The document is adopted by the Working Group (WG) for its internal use.  The WG has decided that it will not pursue publication of it as an RFC.", "id": 37, "name": "Adopted for WG Info Only", "next_states": [], "order": 3, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/37/", "slug": "info", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The document has been identified as a Working Group (WG) document and is under development per Section 7.2 of RFC2418.", "id": 38, "name": "WG Document", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/39/", "/api/v1/doc/state/40/", "/api/v1/doc/state/41/", "/api/v1/doc/state/43/"], "order": 4, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/38/", "slug": "wg-doc", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document is in a temporary state where it will not be actively developed.  The reason for the pause is explained via a datatracker comments section.", "id": 39, "name": "Parked WG Document", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "order": 5, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/39/", "slug": "parked", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document has been abandoned by the WG.  No further development is planned in this WG.  A decision to resume work on this document and move it out of this state is possible.", "id": 40, "name": "Dead WG Document", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "order": 6, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/40/", "slug": "dead", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document is currently subject to an active WG Last Call (WGLC) review per Section 7.4 of RFC2418.", "id": 41, "name": "In WG Last Call", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/38/", "/api/v1/doc/state/42/", "/api/v1/doc/state/43/"], "order": 7, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/41/", "slug": "wg-lc", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The progression of this Working Group (WG) document towards publication is paused as it awaits implementation. The process governing the approach to implementations is WG-specific.", "id": 145, "name": "Waiting for Implementation", "next_states": [], "order": 8, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/145/", "slug": "waiting-for-implementation", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "Held by Working Group (WG) chairs for administrative reasons.  See document history for details.", "id": 146, "name": "Held by WG", "next_states": [], "order": 9, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/146/", "slug": "held-by-wg", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document has completed Working Group Last Call (WGLC), but the WG chairs are not yet ready to call consensus on the document. The reasons for this may include comments from the WGLC need to be responded to, or a revision to the document is needed.", "id": 42, "name": "Waiting for WG Chair Go-Ahead", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/41/", "/api/v1/doc/state/43/"], "order": 10, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/42/", "slug": "chair-w", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document has consensus to proceed to publication.  However, the document is waiting for a document shepherd write-up per RFC4858.", "id": 43, "name": "WG Consensus: Waiting for Write-Up", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "order": 11, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/43/", "slug": "writeupw", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}, {"desc": "The Working Group (WG) document has been submitted to the Internet Engineering Steering Group (IESG) for evaluation and publication per Section 7.4 of RFC2418.  See the “IESG State” or “RFC Editor State” for further details on the state of the document.", "id": 44, "name": "Submitted to IESG for Publication", "next_states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/38/"], "order": 12, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/state/44/", "slug": "sub-pub", "type": "/api/v1/doc/statetype/draft-stream-ietf/", "used": true}]}